| 4f | RIGHT AFTER | the rite's heal list (operator, 2026-11-17: //"future operators with lots of faces will be grateful this serves as a bridge we burn behind us and a smoother operational flow in future big maintenance projects."//; the items at lar:///ha.ka.ba/kahua/memory/project/rite-heal-list): the prompts and passphrases (a face switch on an open vessel asking the route again, a keep lei offered to every face, a paper sheet printing before its refusal, the down and up a face with paper takes, cold-key cards left in scrollback, the wear under a pūlama, a mistyped pūlama route reading as none given); `up` blind to a stale vessel and its dirt warning; export and import (the pin budget against the wiki count, an empty wiki carrying nowhere, unregistered leftover folders, an import that leaves a standing row reading `already`, a minted wiki reading `document-unavailable` until held); the card, the guards and the census's two known red shapes (riding rank 13b). BUILT on `develop`: the pūlama route reading what it heard (`6d3d9b399`), the paper sheet refused before it prints (`5edfadc18`), parity's flags taking every path (`8fe52f79a`); confirmed cold-key cards leaving the screen and a minted wiki standing held (PR #226); the repeated route and the wear under a pūlama healed by unlock and `lares wear N` (PR #235); every disk file read back by its own title or named as skipped (PR #241); the keep lei one per house with its face derived (`515a73bd4`, PR #303); `down`'s remedy naming `wear N`, a refusal naming its code once, and `vessel read` naming an image skew (PR #303); status reads printing a plain summary through a pipe (PR #305); `up` naming a pūlama on an older image and `pulama restand` (PR #306); the keep's secret guard reading key material, never a header (PR #306, #309); `up` onto a moved image running the down path first, the dirty-tree refusal and its warning retired (PR #310); `lay` setting aside the pre-face-root folders (PR #313); an empty last-worn-face sending no wear and `down` saving the vessel's log (PR #314). Ruled 2026-11-18 (#/rulings): the repeated route and the wear under a pūlama heal by unlock and wear, every route prompt naming whose route it asks, and the keep lei offered to every face heals by one keep lei per house (backlog-awakens Wave 4). Owed, with holders: Lares-Awakens the paper-sheet down and up dance (backlog-awakens Wave 5); Lares-Alpha the bundle (backlog-alpha #/next: empty wikis travelling, unread by this truing since `2696d0b95`, leftover folders, `already` versus stood off, the census's shapes with rank 13b) | The operator's house move met each of them on a real terminal, and every later big maintenance walks the same found, persona, unlock, export, import and keep doors. |

